   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "A confession for a Zelda article: Nero has only played the opening of Ocarina of Time. He knows it through dear friends who loved it. His own Zelda was a different one, and it came with a story.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "When he got his first GameCube as a boy, a game came with it: The Wind Waker. He didn't want it, so he asked the shopkeeper to “take the game out of the console”. The shopkeeper was confused. Taking it out would only save him about ten euros. So, reluctantly, the game came home too.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
